    "source": "diagnostic per-strand evidence; not an official TSIA2 score or readiness prediction",
    "rules": [
      "Assign a separate starting level per strand, not a single student-wide level.",
      "Insufficient evidence routes to Foundation or a short confirmation check, never assumed mastery.",
      "After a checkpoint, adjust only the affected strand level.",
      "Teachers may override recommendations without erasing attempts or points.",
      "Preserve original diagnostic attempt and subsequent reassessments."
    ]
